Open https://books.toscrape.com/ . All three books below are on this first page of the main catalogue list (scroll down; you do not need pagination or categories). Find these books by exact title:
{items}
For each book open its product page and read the title, the price (shown in pounds) and any shipping information. The site shows no shipping cost: set shipping_cost to null, total equal to price, currency GBP, and say so in notes. The url you report must be the product page address you opened. Report one result per book (site = books.toscrape.com). Then call done. Do not log in, add anything to a basket, or leave the site.
